"This filter is found in the main menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Render</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Pattern</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Spiral…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Este filtro está no menu principal em "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filtros</guimenu><guisubmenu>Renderizar</guisubmenu><guisubmenu>Padrão</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Espiral…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

